    "description": "<p>Some Spacers may just be &ldquo;a guy in a suit&rdquo; and all of their abilities come from a specialized suit of power armor with weapons and features built into it.</p><p><b>Species Trait:</b> Any, including Life Support. You do not require external food, drink, or air to function while connected to your Life Support. You still need to rest and your armor requires a power charge equivalent to a rest to maintain its operational level.<br><b>Archetype:</b> Machine-Based Archetype.<br><b>Background / Motivation:</b> Power Armor Spacers can choose any background or motivation.<br><b>The Triad:</b> Power Armor Spacers can take The Triad as a Species Trait.</p>",
